{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Hunt is an action-packed roguelite experience in the style of Vampire Survivors. Players battle waves of enemies, collect loot, and permanently strengthen their character.<br><br>Game Features:<br><br>Endless Enemy Waves: Face different enemy types such as flying eyes, red orbs, and robots. Each wave brings a greater challenge.<br><br>Different Cards: As players progress, they can choose upgrade cards to customize their character. Speed, attack, abilities, and more await.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/f4d54dca0b2601614e5fe92093ff764b.poster.avif?t=1768110661\" aria-label=\"Collect Gems\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/f4d54dca0b2601614e5fe92093ff764b.webm?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/f4d54dca0b2601614e5fe92093ff764b.mp4?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Powerful Bosses: Bosses with unique attack patterns and high durability challenge you. Each victory grants great rewards.<br><br>New Outfits: Customize your character with different costumes. Some unlock through quests, others as rewards.<br><br>Rage Mode &amp; Combo System: Enter rage mode to enhance abilities. Combos increase rage power, making attacks deadlier.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/c1125579c5ddd6ac711e1ac67d2ddd14.poster.avif?t=1768110661\" aria-label=\"Rage Mode\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/c1125579c5ddd6ac711e1ac67d2ddd14.webm?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/c1125579c5ddd6ac711e1ac67d2ddd14.mp4?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>2-Player Coop: Play with a friend, defeat waves, and conquer bosses together.<br><br>Leaderboard: Compete for the highest score and reach the top!<br><br>Immersive Visuals: Pixel art style delivers both action and atmosphere.<br><br>Simple but Fun: No complex controls. Just fight, survive, and grow stronger.<br><br>Eternal Hunt is fast-paced, action-filled, and addictive. Each run is a new adventure worth replaying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/11729e7c85adf8fcecd4cf0eab2bb95d.poster.avif?t=1768110661\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/11729e7c85adf8fcecd4cf0eab2bb95d.webm?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835010/extras/11729e7c85adf8fcecd4cf0eab2bb95d.mp4?t=1768110661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Goal: Survive, defeat bosses, build combos, and climb the leaderboard!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Thousand More!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835010/feea7a1181989d89abe28c9004c82ba673876d5e.jpg"},{"name":"How Many Left?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835010/feea7a1181989d89abe28c9004c82ba673876d5e.jpg"},{"name":"Enough Already!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835010/feea7a1181989d89abe28c9004c82ba673876d5e.jpg"},{"name":"Oops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3835010/eb42a5305612caa787e85bafef0797ed771a304a.jpg"},{"name":